Package: foosball3
Title: An App to Manage and Organise Foosball Tournaments
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Pepijn", "de Vries", role = c("aut", "cre", "dtc"),
    email = "pepijn.devries@outlook.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7961-6646")))
Author:
    Pepijn de Vries [aut, cre, dtc] (0000-0002-7961-6646)
Description: A relational SQLite database is used at the core of
    this package to manage foosball tournaments. A graphical user
    interface offers easy access to the database, it also allows to
    visualise (historical) data and account player history.
    It has all features required to facilitate a live tournament.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
